<view class="page">
  <view class="panel">
    <text class="title">快速新增</text>
    <text class="desc">这里是中间异形 Tab 对应的新增页，可以继续接入表单、金额键盘和分类选择。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="action-list">
    <view class="action-card expense">
      <text class="action-icon">-</text>
      <text class="action-title">新增支出</text>
      <text class="action-desc">餐饮、交通、购物等</text>
    </view>
    <view class="action-card income">
      <text class="action-icon">+</text>
      <text class="action-title">新增收入</text>
      <text class="action-desc">工资、奖金、兼职等</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
